        <description>
            During the Artemis missions, Houston Mission Control voice loops were recorded on the ground.
            The Orion to Earth (O/E) voice loops were the primary means of direct communication between
            Mission Control and the crew on the Orion spacecraft during the mission. Additional science
            voice loops for communication with the Science Console in the Flight Control Room and the
            Science Evaluation Room (SER) were also recorded.
        </description>
